# Web3 Agent Skills — Windsurf Rules (example)

Load AGENTS.md and guardrails/web3-guardrails.yaml at session start.

- Never expose private keys or seed phrases
- Simulate all transactions before execution
- Screen recipient addresses via compliance MCP before transfers
- Require user confirmation for transactions over $10,000 USD
- Use chain presets from presets/ for RPC and contract addresses

Copy to `.windsurfrules` or merge into your Windsurf rules file.
